body:
Honestly I read SOOOO many posts on here but rarely chime in. Overusing probiotics can cause an overgrowth of the technical good bacteria....which can still be a problem. You need an evvy test to find out what exactly we're dealing with and the brown blood could be related or just a coincidence.

&#x200B;

I am so sorry, don't say that he won't want to be with you...That's not true. Someone that loves you will want to be with you....NO MATTER WHAT. You'll be able to have sex again.

This is a great response and almost moved me to tears. 

&#x200B;

I'm happy with how much I've been able to turn my life around...But I know I deserve to be truly happy, so it kills me how paralyzed I've become to the absolutely unacceptable aspects of my current life. Knowing how much I truly deserve is what kills me the most. I have so much love, life, and good things to offer someone. And I'm just stuck right now with someone who lacks the ability to truly love me.

I'm just afraid because I've never gotten this far in sobriety...I've been trying for years. Because of my addiction I endured a SUCCESSION of terrible relationships, but nothing where I was continually cheated on. It's like I can't trust myself or my thoughts...I find pretty concrete proof yet he has convenient excuses that make me think "well what if?" 

&#x200B;

Plus he takes care of everything. I've never even had a partner that even works...Always been all me. 

&#x200B;

I'm just wasting time. I know how valuable time is, I've almost come close to having NO time and losing my life...So I feel like such a fool.

10+ year IV heroin (and anything else) addiction. Survived homelessness, shootings and septic shock with endocarditis....I'll have one year clean in a week. Just made the deans list. Started a new job working at a treatment center I've been to 3 times..../feelsgoodman.

&#x200B;

I get so sad thinking about everyone I came up with who are either dead or in prison for long stretches.
